Claudia is an open character by anabology (https://claudia.gallery).

Her name, look and story belong to their creator and are used here under the
character's open terms (https://claudia.gallery/use): anyone may make work with
her, commercial or not; a credit "Claudia by anabology" is appreciated.

The terms ask that she stays recognisable (the black bob, one clay streak, the
star clip, the mic, an adult face) and that she is always an adult, with nothing
under-age or explicit. This plugin keeps to that.

